  <item>
    <title>Ep03 喝茶随谈 编剧的纠结 心在岩石上生长</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67489590c3b2a2f33434f9d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67489590c3b2a2f33434f9d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2024 20:44:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客特意选在感恩季，邀请了一位老友【老蒙】来录喝茶随谈。她是资深影视编剧、作家，也是我999纯金的酒友！八年终于第一次坐上茶桌，清醒地、全面地分享彼此人生路上的岔路口抉择，期待茶可以带我们进入一个新的能量场，撇开老友滤镜，产生新的碰撞。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期内容比较原生，茶馆比较吵闹，大家请见谅～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrVhLZa1xxfpDEN_HxH5Hucm7uFW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFDm2pl2o4rjZOLhO72P4T_a2Zq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lodAwPrX1qTDkd2KHk0bOT2t-HPt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Show Notes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 老酒友重聚在茶桌上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a> 头汤，城市人对风味感知的能力是“干枯“吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 内容是为了取悦大众还是自我表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 电视编剧眼里的HK vs SH</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3619">1:00:19</a> 市区租房和郊区租房真的差很多吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3977">1:06:17</a> 原生家庭带来的第一个人生分岔路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4336">1:12:16</a> 好的恋爱会让青春期发光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5073">1:24:33</a> 大家在上海好像都摸到了人生的重点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5582">1:33:02</a> 你别小看一片小茶叶，也别小看自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>【标题解读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>理论也许会带你走上一条平坦结实的水泥路，但实践永远会为你揭开不期而遇的惊喜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/limEiVS3py5cyvM-Fy768vICkQ4Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsK7mYzQpvH-YU4QMKzRMIL7VL0y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZeGV95RuAX2IqRN0HhphBxWyH2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Remark】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不减口癖之后，发现自己还挺结巴的==、</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltBUxkTpUV7RKhKB79n3A_7-HSQO.m4a" length="106584982" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:49:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjup9Stktb7N0gQIgnzAjp7ECqPf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep02 茶与自愈 致困在时间里的我们</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734ce1343dc3a438769aa0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734ce1343dc3a438769aa0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 21:16:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是一集单口，自述了一个边喝茶边走出失恋的故事。遇见问题、直面问题、拆解问题、反哺成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show Notes】：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 满觉陇真的是一个非常神奇的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a> 这一期的主题叫做困在时间里的我们吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 思考亲密关系的下一步是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a>我发现了人与人之间存在layer属性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a> 从他“怎么能”变成“他能”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 亲密关系分两层，一层是理想化，一层是袪魅后的重组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 思考不动了，不然试一试漳平水仙吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 被困和解救其实是同一个词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 每一个你认为的被困住的阶段，其实也是正在孵化出新的细胞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 哈喽，大家好，这里是30天之后的我</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期标题解读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>困在时间里的我们，是想表达遇到问题当下感到困惑的“我”以及有类似经历的“你们”。被困与解救其实是同一个词，当下的我们需要意识到这份处境，喝喝茶，慢慢思考，结束或许才是真的开始。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrD3pCS6vnWdhHpgvUx-x_dN920P.m4a" length="34889382" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr2UtRuQrj3Fdg6WRPR6t83wtRkw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep01 喝茶随谈 让占星师感受茶的能量</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d062b9d06ec988f2be4797</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d062b9d06ec988f2be4797</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 11:59:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听我酝酿已久的第一期播客 ( 激动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【多喝热茶 Lim Teh】是一档边喝茶边聊生活的实验播客，主打一个“随机”和“顺势”</span></p><span></span><p><span>以喝茶的自然能量打开感官，由【单口】和【采访】的形式呈现内容，希望大家可以在别人的生活问题里找到自己生活答案的折射点~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客对话了美丽的Coco女士，她的播客是【</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64700ecffcc727e48c04afe6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64700ecffcc727e48c04afe6"><span>宇宙在发笑</span></a><span>】。以实验性随机体验福建功夫茶为中心轴，在感官被自然打开的氛围下，漫谈”亲密关系问题的情绪拆解与反哺“和”高能量人群成长记“</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Show Notes】：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> &nbsp;本期随谈背景，在原生态的环境下是否产生能量碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> &nbsp;闻干香，开启冒险旅程，让思绪随茶汤而流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> &nbsp;喝茶的仪式感如何定义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人生卡壳了，需不需要寻求帮助？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> &nbsp;感官被自然打开了，多喝热茶可不是玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> &nbsp;在不确定的环境下，找到自己最小单位的确定值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a> &nbsp;在第四泡与头汤的轮回中感受【盛开】与【留白】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">48:44</a> &nbsp;比预期更可怕的是理想化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3278">54:38</a> &nbsp;“高人”都有一台自己的发动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3951">1:05:51</a> &nbsp;自己才是现代掌握价值感的神！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期标题解读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“席地而坐”想传达三层含义：第一是对于录播客真实环境的描述；第二是通过茶这个天地间的产物，体会“风味的抽丝剥茧”；第三是感受&lt;人-茶-场&gt;的融合带来的能量闭环</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Remark】</span></p><span></span><p><span>录播客你就会发现自己有多严重的“口癖”！哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！希望我可以少说一点“然后”和“但是”</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢第一期播客老手Co姐的带领，让我超有做这档播客的动力！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢朋友们的收听！由衷欢迎大家在评论区积极互动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢这档播客内容的话，请帮忙点一个订阅哦，谢谢！</span></p>]]></description>
